      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.11",
      "values:originalText": "The Australian Capital Territory is established as a body politic\nunder the Crown by the name of the Australian Capital Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "The Australian Capital Territory is established as a body politic\nunder the Crown by the name of the Australian Capital Territory.",
