      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(3) An enactment providing for the number of members of the\nAssembly (or an enactment amending or repealing such an\nenactment) has no effect unless it is passed by a number of\nmembers at least equal to two-thirds of the number of members\nprovided for, at that time, by or in accordance with subsection (2).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) An enactment providing for the number of members of the\nAssembly (or an enactment amending or repealing such an\nenactment) has no effect unless it is passed by a number of\nmembers at least equal to two-thirds of the number of members\nprovided for, at that time, by or in accordance with subsection (2).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
