    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-11-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "11(3) Presiding Officer of Assembly",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988#sch-5-sec-11-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.13",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If there is a vacancy in the office of Presiding Officer (not because\nof a dissolution of the Assembly), then:\n(a) if the vacancy happens at a meeting, the members present\nshall, before any further business, elect one of their number\nto be the Presiding Officer; or\n(b) if the vacancy happens at any other time, at the next meeting\nthe members present shall, before any other business, elect\none of their number to be the Presiding Officer.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If there is a vacancy in the office of Presiding Officer (not because\nof a dissolution of the Assembly), then:\n(a) if the vacancy happens at a meeting, the members present\nshall, before any further business, elect one of their number\nto be the Presiding Officer; or\n(b) if the vacancy happens at any other time, at the next meeting\nthe members present shall, before any other business, elect\none of their number to be the Presiding Officer.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
