          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-11-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-11-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f703fc9f57fea9a346a65e3d2543c900163f8a5b8cf285c35f4202d82c7edbb3",
      "skos:note": "Members must elect a new Presiding Officer if there is a vacancy."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988#sch-5-sec-11-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "11(3) Presiding Officer of Assembly",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 13,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If there is a vacancy in the office of Presiding Officer (not because\nof a dissolution of the Assembly), then:\n(a) if the vacancy happens at a meeting, the members present\nshall, before any further business, elect one of their number\nto be the Presiding Officer; or\n(b) if the vacancy happens at any other time, at the next meeting\nthe members present shall, before any other business, elect\none of their number to be the Presiding Officer."
    },
