      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "A resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister has no effect\nunless:\n(a) it affirms a motion that is expressed to be a motion of no\nconfidence in the Chief Minister;\n(b) at least one week’s notice of the motion has been given in\naccordance with the standing rules and orders; and\n(c) the resolution is passed by at least the number of members\nnecessary to be a quorum.",
      "skos:definition": "A resolution of no confidence in the Chief Minister has no effect\nunless:\n(a) it affirms a motion that is expressed to be a motion of no\nconfidence in the Chief Minister;\n(b) at least one week’s notice of the motion has been given in\naccordance with the standing rules and orders; and\n(c) the resolution is passed by at least the number of members\nnecessary to be a quorum.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-19-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-19-logic-deontic-1"
        },
