      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Assembly shall cause minutes to be kept of meetings.\n(2) A copy of any minutes so kept shall, on request made by a person:\n(a) be made available for inspection by the person; or\n(b) be supplied to the person on payment of such fee (if any) as\nis fixed by or under enactment.\n(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to minutes of a committee meeting\nheld in private."
