      "cof:title": "22(2) Power of Assembly to make laws",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The power to make laws extends to the power to make laws with\nrespect to the exercise of powers by the Executive."
    },
