      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(3) At the time of publication of the notice under subsection (1) of the\npassing of a proposed law or as soon as practicable thereafter,\ncopies of the law shall be made available for purchase at the place,\nor at each of the places, specified in the notice.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) At the time of publication of the notice under subsection (1) of the\npassing of a proposed law or as soon as practicable thereafter,\ncopies of the law shall be made available for purchase at the place,\nor at each of the places, specified in the notice.",
