      "values:originalText": "(4) While the entrenching law is in force, an enactment to which it\napplies has no effect unless made in accordance with the\nentrenching law.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) While the entrenching law is in force, an enactment to which it\napplies has no effect unless made in accordance with the\nentrenching law.",
