      "cml:premiseText": "(4) The exercise of the powers of the Chief Minister by the Deputy\nChief Minister during the absence of the Chief Minister from Australia does not affect the exercise of a power by the Chief\nMinister.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The exercise of the powers of the Chief Minister by the Deputy\nChief Minister during the absence of the Chief Minister from Australia overlaps with the exercise of a power by the Chief\nMinister."
    },
    {
