      "cml:premiseText": "Holding office as a Minister is an obligation.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "A Minister must vacate office under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-46-ss-2",
