    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "59(2) Financial relations between Commonwealth and Territory",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988#sch-5-sec-59-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Territory is not liable to bear the cost, or part of the cost, of:\n(a) any power of the Commonwealth relating to a matter referred\nto in section 23;\n(b) administering a law, or a provision of a law, referred to in\nSchedule 5; or\n(c) any other power of the Commonwealth, or of a\nCommonwealth authority, relating to the Territory.\n\n\nFinance  Part VII\n\nSection 60\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Territory is not liable to bear the cost, or part of the cost, of:\n(a) any power of the Commonwealth relating to a matter referred\nto in section 23;\n(b) administering a law, or a provision of a law, referred to in\nSchedule 5; or\n(c) any other power of the Commonwealth, or of a\nCommonwealth authority, relating to the Territory.\n\n\nFinance  Part VII\n\nSection 60\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59-ss-2-norm"
