          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-59-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2e27442422f5b24ca3141fd0bdeb98d6657e4a1af578105878e1a82f0bcef5cb",
      "skos:note": "The Territory is not liable to bear the cost of certain Commonwealth powers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988#sch-5-sec-59-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "59(2) Financial relations between Commonwealth and Territory",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Territory is not liable to bear the cost, or part of the cost, of:\n(a) any power of the Commonwealth relating to a matter referred\nto in section 23;\n(b) administering a law, or a provision of a law, referred to in\nSchedule 5; or\n(c) any other power of the Commonwealth, or of a\nCommonwealth authority, relating to the Territory.\n\n\nFinance  Part VII\n\nSection 60\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024"
    },
