      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "This Part binds the Crown in right of the Territory, but nothing in\nthis Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence.",
      "skos:definition": "This Part binds the Crown in right of the Territory, but nothing in\nthis Act renders the Crown liable to be prosecuted for an offence.",
