    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-69",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "69 Trade and commerce to be free",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988#sch-5-sec-69"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988.pdf, p.39",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), trade, commerce and intercourse between\nthe Territory and a State, and between the Territory and the\nNorthern Territory, Norfolk Island, the Jervis Bay Territory, the\nTerritory of Christmas Island or the Territory of Cocos (Keeling)\nIslands, shall be absolutely free.\n(2) Subsection (1) does not bind the Commonwealth.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subsection (2), trade, commerce and intercourse between\nthe Territory and a State, and between the Territory and the\nNorthern Territory, Norfolk Island, the Jervis Bay Territory, the\nTerritory of Christmas Island or the Territory of Cocos (Keeling)\nIslands, shall be absolutely free.\n(2) Subsection (1) does not bind the Commonwealth.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-69-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-capital-territory-self-government-act-1988-sch-5-sec-69-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5873a91dcbabdff96330200eb2487608e760bf6af3ce11f3614b5322b97da9f1"
    },
