      "values:originalText": "Sch 1 (item 1): 30 July\n1998 (s 2(1))\n—\n\nEndnotes\nEndnote 3—Legislation history\nAustralian Capital Territory (Self-Government) Act 1988\nCompilation date: 11/12/2024\nAct\nNumber\nand year\nAssent\nCommencement\nApplication,\nsaving and\ntransitional\nprovisions\nAustralian Capital\nTerritory Legislation\nAmendment Act 2003\n1, 2003",
